<title>USA: Bergen Cty, N.J., won by ABN AMRO.</title>
<headline>Bergen Cty, N.J., won by ABN AMRO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Securities said it won $25 million of Bergen Cty, N.J., general improvement bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.24 percent.</p>
</text>
